<title>USA: Rollins Truck Leasing Corp buys back stock.</title>
<headline>Rollins Truck Leasing Corp buys back stock.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, De 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rollins Truck Leasing Corp said Monday it had purchased for cash and retired a total of 490,200 shares of its $1 per value common stock during its second fiscal quarter ending March 31.</p>
</text>
